// Custom code for the Google Ads custom connector.
//
// Google Ads reads all go through one GAQL search endpoint. Every action of this connector is
// routed here: the script builds the GAQL query from the action's inputs, calls
// googleAds:search (following page tokens), merges all-time metrics, and returns flat rows whose
// keys are the Dataverse column names (without the sanidi_ prefix).
//
// The connector itself has no sign-in. GetAccessToken exchanges the Google OAuth client ID, client
// secret and refresh token (kept in environment variables) for an access token; every other action
// takes that access token and the Google Ads developer token as headers.
//
// The OPS block is generated by build_definition.py from spec.py. Do not edit it by hand.
